{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/4604-arts-crafts-and-creative-avenues","id":4604,"title":"Arts, Crafts and Creative Avenues.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-06T14:42:26-08:00","id":4604,"title":"Arts, Crafts and Creative Avenues.","content":"This thread is for posting what you are building, working on, etc. That includes: Papercraft, Origami, Plastic Models, Miniatures, Code, Gaming, Coding Games, Woodcraft, Leatherworking, Smithing, Sewing, Quilting, and anything else you can think of. <br /> <br /> I build plastic models and paint miniatures mostly. I just got a box in the mail with a couple of kits in it. Going to be starting one this week. Not sure if I want to do the Panzer Ausf D or the M4 Armored 81mm Mortar Truck. Thinking the truck because it looks so unique. Its just an M4 armored truck with a mortar in the back. I'm also building the Z'Gok MG from Bandai. Its a snapfit kit so its not hard to build but its all about paint because its an older kit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>pls respont","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/372-cerealkiller","name":"cerealkiller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar372_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-06T15:19:00-08:00","id":4640,"title":"","content":"I paint warhammer as relaxing hobbie. Im currently building an Wood Elves Army because apparently i like loosing a lot. And i buy random minis for RP.<br /> This are some Tau Fire warriors i painted and did a little mod to use as Renraku Red Samurais for Shadowrun<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://img811.imageshack.us/img811/6393/4pwk.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><u>Rule number 1</u></b></div> <div align=\"center\">Assume players are bastards, bastard coated bastards with bastard filling until proven otherwise.</div> <div align=\"center\"><b><u>Rule number 2</u></b></div> <div align=\"center\">I don't care about the theme of personal horror.</div>","edited":{"userid":121,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/121-kaho","user":"kaho","date":". 11-07-2013, 03:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/121-kaho","name":"kaho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"97"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-07T11:20:32-08:00","id":5253,"title":"","content":"I crochet mainly baby items (special order the yarns from China because of the blends) but I am working on a scarf for Mom, a duckie afghan for next year's county fair and 2 afghans. I have crochet up a Cthulhu doll for a kid with autism a few years ago and she is still sleepiing with it, especially since her father died not too long ago. I am trying to download a pattern for Smaug but the designer used an evil PDF file system (you try to download it, it changes your preferences on your computer). I am trying to learn to knit but my left hand does not understand what it is suppose to do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Bipolar vampire...can't decide to feast for fun or for rage...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/101-jadedtruebrujah","name":"JadedTrueBrujah","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatar